{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10551","headline":"和王七玉门关听吹笛 · 高适","name":"和王七玉门关听吹笛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"胡人吹笛戍楼间，楼上萧条海月闲。\n借问落梅凡几曲，从风一夜满关山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10551.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10551","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《才调集》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/才調集_(四庫全書本)）"}